# This is the source catalog for workstation-utils/macos/setup.sh.
#
# Entries are deliberately disabled when this file is passed directly to
# `brew bundle`: installing the complete catalog would silently bypass profile
# and optional-package selection. setup.sh reads the adjacent metadata and
# streams a filtered Brewfile to Homebrew Bundle.

